# REST

###login(ADMIN)
POST http://localhost:9093/admin/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "",
  "password": "",
  "rememberMe": true
}

###login(USER)
POST http://localhost:9093/api/auth/local
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "identifier": "",
  "password": "",
  "rememberMe": true
}


###Signup
POST http://localhost:9093/api/auth/register-admin
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "",
  "email": "",
  "password": ""
}


###Forgot
POST http://localhost:9093/api/auth/local/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": ""
}


###Profile
PUT http://localhost:9093/admin/users/me
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: 

{
  "email": "",
  "firstname": "",
  "lastname": "",
  "username": 
}
